{"sourceUrl":"https://phys.swjtu.edu.cn/info/1034/58581.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:22.524161+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://phys.swjtu.edu.cn/info/1034/58581.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><br/></p><p><span><span>为</span></span><span>切实</span><span><span>做好我院</span></span><span>接收</span><span>2027<span>年推荐免试</span></span><span>攻读</span><span><span>研究生（含直博生）</span></span><span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免生</span><span>”</span><span>）</span></span><span><span>工作，</span></span><span>根据教育部及学校相关管理规定，</span><span>现将报名工作相关事项通知如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一</span></strong><strong><span>、接收类型及专业</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）</span><span><span>推免生类型：</span></span><span>硕士</span><span><span>推免生、直接攻读博士研究生</span></span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span><span>接收专业</span></span></p><div><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>专业名称</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>学位类型</span></span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span><span>招收类型</span></span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>070200</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>物理学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士</span><span><span>推免生</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>080900</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>电子科学与技术</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>硕士</span><span><span>推免生</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>070200</span></span></p></td><td><p><span>物理学</span></p></td><td><p><span><span>学术学位</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>直博生</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><span><span>注：拟接收推免生人数以学校</span></span><span>后续</span><span><span>发布的《西南交通大学</span>2027<span>年硕士研究生招生章程暨专业目录》为准</span></span><span>，各</span><span>学院</span><span><span>接收推免生的总人数原则上不超过学校当年全日制硕士研究生招生人数的</span><span>50%</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>二</span></strong><strong><span>、申请条件</span></strong></p><p><span>申请人</span><span><span>应当符合以下申请条件：</span></span></p><p><span>（一）</span><span>遵守中华人民共和国宪法和法律、诚实守信</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span>不存在考试作弊和学术不端行为。</span></p><p><span>（三）成绩优秀，系统掌握本学科专业领域的基础理论、专业知识和基本技能；具有从事科学研究、专业实践的能力和基础，以及较强的创新意识和潜质。</span></p><p><span>（四）申请人应为经教育部批准具有推免资格的高校应届本科毕业生，取得所在学校推免资格</span><span>或预计获得推免资格</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>（五）</span><span>身体健康状况符合国家规定和我校相关专业的要求。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>三</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）</span><span><span>报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>考生提前准备以下材料扫描件</span></span><span>：</span></p><p><span><span>1. </span></span><span><span>居民身份证正反面复印件</span></span></p><p><span><span>2. </span><span>本人学生证（须注册至第七学期）</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span></span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告</span></span></p><p><span><span>4. </span></span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单</span></span><span>（加盖所在学校教务部门公章）</span></p><p><span><span>5. </span><span>大学英语四级或六级成绩报告单</span></span></p><p><span><span>6. </span><span>本人自述（</span></span><span>包括基本情况、学习情况、获奖及发表文章情况及攻读研究生的学习和科研计划等</span><span>）</span></p><p><span><span>7. </span></span><span><span>学术</span></span><span>科研</span><span><span>成果</span></span><span>及获奖情况</span><span><span>证明材料</span></span><span>（按照本人自述中各类成果顺序提供）</span></p><p><span><span>8. </span><span>本人签名的诚信承诺书</span></span></p><p><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>. </span><span>本科阶段成绩排名证明（证明应加盖院系或学校相关部门的公章后扫描）和个人简历。</span></span></p><p><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>. </span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span>还</span><span><span>须提供至少两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授</span>(<span>或相当正高级专业技术职务的专家</span><span>)</span><span>的书面推荐意见</span></span><span>（推荐书下载地址：</span><span>https://yz.swjtu.edu.cn/vatuu/WebAction?setAction=fileList&amp;viewType=web&amp;selectType=typeId&amp;keyWord=61E92EF67418DC54</span><span>）（专家专业技术职务证书复印件请一并附上）</span></p><p><span><span>物理科学与技术学院</span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年研究生招生团队介绍：<a href=\"https://phys.swjtu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjspy/yjstdjs.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://phys.swjtu.edu.cn/rcpy/yjspy/yjstdjs.htm</a></span></span></p><p><span>请</span><span><span>将以上</span></span><span>材料</span><span><span>按</span></span><span>照</span><span>1-</span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>项顺序整理为一个</span>pdf<span>文件</span></span><span>，以</span><span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>学校</span><span>+</span><span>报考专业名称</span><span>+</span><span>招收类型</span><span>+</span><span>电话</span></span><span><span>命名，于</span><span>2026</span><span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>15</span></span><span><span>日</span><span>17</span><span>：</span><span>00</span><span>前提交，提交地址：<a href=\"https://workspace.jianguoyun.com/inbox/collect/5f8f65b360f94d4f9beee98ab059dac0/submitv2\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://workspace.jianguoyun.com/inbox/collect/5f8f65b360f94d4f9beee98ab059dac0/submitv2</a></span></span></p><p><span><span>提交材料后，学生申请加入</span><span>“</span></span><span>物理</span><span><span>学院</span>2027<span>级推免通知群</span><span>”</span><span>，群</span><span>QQ</span><span>号为</span></span><span>1121983975</span><span><span>，进群需要用</span><span>“</span><span>姓名</span><span>+</span><span>本科学校名称</span><span>”</span><span>进行验证。此群仅作通知使用。</span></span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span><span>材料审核</span></span></p><p><span>学院将依照上级政策及相关</span><span><span>工作要求，</span></span><span>成立材料审核专家组，根据申请情况</span><span><span>对申请材料</span></span><span>分批次</span><span><span>进行</span></span><span>审核。学院将根据材料审核</span><span>情况</span><span>择优</span><span><span>确定进入复试考核的考生名单</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>（三）</span><span><span>复试考核</span></span></p><p><span><span>1. </span><span>考核</span></span><span><span>形式：网络远程</span></span><span>面试</span></p><p><span><span>2. 考核</span></span><span><span>时间：考核工作将依据上级政策开展，具体时间另行通知</span></span><span>。</span><span><span>学院可根据申请学生情况及时遴选，</span></span><span>组织多批次复试考核</span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3. </span><span>考核内容：</span></span><span>复试考核将对考生德智体美劳各方面进行全面考查，重点关注思想政治和品德、对本学科知识的掌握、科研创新潜质、综合运用专业知识能力、外语水平、人文素养等。</span></p><p><span>（四）待</span><span><span>录取</span></span></p><p><span>学院根据推免指标，</span><span><span>按各专业</span></span><span>综合</span><span><span>成绩从高分到低分进行拟录取</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>并通过教育部</span><span>“</span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>（以下简称</span><span>“</span><span>推免服务系统</span><span>”</span><span>，网址：</span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span>）</span></span><span>分批次</span><span><span>发送待录取通知。</span></span><span><span>综合成绩低于</span>60<span>分不予录取，思想政治素质和品德考核不合格不予录取</span></span><span>。</span><span>申请人同意接受我校待录取通知后，学校不再取消待录取。</span></p><p><strong><span>四</span></strong><strong><span>、其他</span></strong><strong><span>说明</span></strong></p><p><span>（一）</span><span><span>本次报名工作仅为了解考生的途径之一，推免生正式报名和录取工作必须通过</span></span><span>教育部</span><span><span>推免服务系统进行，正式待录取结果以推免服务系统信息为准。</span></span><span>请各位考生务必在规定时间内登录推免服务系统报考我校，并及时接收和确认系统发送的复试通知及待录取通知。</span></p><p><span>（二）</span><span>本次</span><span><span>报名报考学科专业及研究方向仅供参考，我院</span>2027<span>年推免专业目录最终以推免服务系统公布为准。</span></span></p><p><span>（三）我院</span><span><span>“</span><span>退役大学生士兵计划</span><span>”</span><span>不接收推免生。</span></span></p><p><span>（四）</span><span><span>尚未确定但仍有希望获得推免生资格的考生可同样进行本次报名，正式报名阶段未取得推免生资格的，</span></span><span>本次</span><span><span>报名自动无效。</span></span></p><p><span>（五）</span><span><span>申请者应提供真实、准确的材料。对在选拔过程中弄虚作假，</span></span><span>存在考试作弊、</span><span><span>论文抄袭、虚报获奖或科研成果等学术不端行为的学生，</span></span><span>或有其他严重影响推免过程和结果公平公正行为的学生，</span><span><span>一经查实，取消推免生资格</span></span><span>、录取资格和学籍，</span><span><span>并报省级教育招生考试机构按规定记入《国家教育考试考生诚信档案》，</span></span><span>通报其所在学校、记入学生人事档案，作为其今后升学和就业的重要参考依据。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>六</span><span>）</span><span>严格执行</span><span>回避制度</span><span>。</span><span>考生</span><span>如有直系亲属或其他利益相关者</span><span>为我单位</span><span>中层及以上领导干部</span><span>或推免招生工作人员的，</span><span>应</span><span>在申请或报名时</span><span>主动报备。</span></p><p><span>（</span><span>七</span><span>）本通知内容如遇与后续国家和教育部文件不一致的，以国家和教育部文件为准。如国家政策规定发生变化，我院将在学校指导下依据政策规定变化对当年推免生接收工作进行调整。</span></p><p><strong><span>五</span></strong><strong><span>、</span></strong><strong><span>咨询方式</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人</span><span>：</span><span>王</span><span>老师</span></p><p><span>联系</span><span>电话</span><span>：</span><span><span>028-6636</span></span><span><span>7838</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱：</span><span><span>jingyawang</span></span><span><span>@swjtu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>西南交通大学</span></span><span>物理科学与技术</span><span><span>学院</span></span></p><p><span>                                                                                                                                                                                                                       2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p><p><strong> </strong></p><p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"464828d422bb40baa90e9e3fe16a65b978a32e847aae51d5a8adada3e7d7ea78","textLength":2291,"sourceSha256":"9f0eb5c1c38b20ef33f70485a909dbd88d5dfebb867541177e41d868f7dcbcba","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"诚信承诺书.docx","url":"https://phys.swjtu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2114060028&wbfileid=FD86B3906028E79CC211FA328CD7DFFE"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a3e608ab99ab7a811c56","title":"2026年西南交通大学物理科学与技术学院2027年接收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）报名工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:22.524161+00:00"}
